<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n49950" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ustŭlo</span></b> , āvi,
			ātum, 1, v. a.
		id.. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b> In gen., <i>to burn a little</i>, <i>to scorch</i>, <i>singe</i> (very rare; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">syn. amburo): palos,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Vitr.
					5, 12</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">taleas oleagineas,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. 1,
				5</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">caput ferventi ferro,</span>”
				i. e. <i>to crisp the hair</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Auct. Priap. 46</span></i>
			.—* </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b> Pregn., <i>to burn up</i>, <i>consume</i> by fire: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">scripta lignis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cat.
					36, 8</span></i>
			.— * </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>, <i>to pinch</i>, <i>nip</i>, or <i>blast</i> with cold: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">gemmas (arboris) frigoris aurā,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Auct. Priap. 62</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
    <div class="alpheios-lex-alph-source">From <u>
            <u>A Latin Dictionary</u>
        </u> (Charlton T. Lewis, Charles Short, Oxford, Clarendon Press, 1879) </div>
